.\" Generated by docs/reference/generate-man.py from cps --help.
.TH "CPS-UPGRADE" 1 "" "CPS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&cps\-upgrade \- \&Upgrade the installed packages, or report available upgrades with \-\-check
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP 4
.B \&cps upgrade [OPTIONS]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \&\-\-root <IMAGE>
\&Operate on this offline image instead of the running system
.TP
.B \&\-\-config <CONFIG>
\&Distribution configuration of the running system [default: /etc/cps/image.kdl]
.TP
.B \&\-y, \-\-yes
\&Confirm the displayed transaction without prompting
.TP
.B \&\-n, \-\-dry\-run
\&Preview the transaction without applying it
.TP
.B \&\-\-save\-plan <PLAN>
\&Save the exact transaction plan, for `cps status \-\-plan` or a later `cps apply`
.TP
.B \&\-\-no\-recommends
\&Skip recommended packages when resolving the transaction
.TP
.B \&\-\-no\-refresh
\&Use the currently cached catalogs (images always plan from their cache)
.TP
.B \&\-\-stage
\&Stage the change in a new Btrfs trial boot environment, or for repair and revert a verified recovery root, instead of changing the running root
.TP
.B \&\-\-check
\&Report upgrades, blockers, and any reboot requirement without changing anything
.TP
.B \&\-\-explain <PACKAGE>
\&With \-\-check, probe the exact newer version of this held\-back package
.TP
.B \&\-\-json
\&With \-\-check, report the result as JSON
.TP
.B \&\-\-force\-rollout
\&Upgrade even if this image is outside the signed profile rollout
.TP
.B \&\-\-base\-only
\&Use only the distribution publishers
.TP
.B \&\-h, \-\-help
\&Print help
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cps (1)
